### 1. POST - Create course
POST http://localhost:3000/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Spanish Beginner",
  "description": "A beginner course for learning Spanish.",
  "language": "Spanish",
  "level": "A1"
}

###

### 2. POST - Invalid data
POST http://localhost:3000/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "A",
  "description": "Hi",
  "language": "Spanish",
  "level": "D5"
}

###

### 3. GET - All courses
GET http://localhost:3000/api/courses

###

### 4. GET - Existing course
GET http://localhost:3000/api/courses/6ac7f9e2a5d30522dabbef6c

###

### 5. GET - Missing course
GET http://localhost:3000/api/courses/000000000000000000000000

###

### 6. PUT - Update existing course
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/courses/6ac7f9e2a5d30522dabbef6c
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Spanish Beginner Updated",
  "description": "An updated beginner course for learning Spanish.",
  "language": "Spanish",
  "level": "A2"
}

###

### 7. PUT - Missing course
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/courses/000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "French Beginner",
  "description": "A beginner course for learning French.",
  "language": "French",
  "level": "A1"
}

###

### 8. PUT - Invalid data
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/courses/6ac7f9e2a5d30522dabbef6c
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "A",
  "description": "Hi",
  "language": "Spanish",
  "level": "D5"
}

###

### 9. DELETE - Existing course
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/courses/6ac7f9e2a5d30522dabbef6c

###

### 10. DELETE - Missing course
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/courses/000000000000000000000000

###

### 11. GET - Filter by language
GET http://localhost:3000/api/courses?language=Spanish

###

### 12. GET - Filter by level
GET http://localhost:3000/api/courses?level=A2


### =========================
### LESSONS
### =========================

### 13. GET - All lessons
GET http://localhost:3000/api/lessons

###

### 14. POST - Create lesson
POST http://localhost:3000/api/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Basic Spanish Greetings",
  "content": "In this lesson students learn common Spanish greetings and introductions.",
  "courseId": "6ac7f9e2a5d30522dabbef6c"
}

###

### 15. GET - Existing lesson
GET http://localhost:3000/api/lessons/6ac7faeba5d30522dabbef6e

###

### 16. GET - Lessons by course
GET http://localhost:3000/api/lessons?courseId=6ac7f9e2a5d30522dabbef6c